00:30:18,560 --> 00:30:50,400
to the point you just made is that in the white paper, it showed that US based developers are more likely to lean on subscriptions, but the developers in Asia, in other parts of the world who actually understand their markets better, you see in the data and there's pie charts and things in this white paper showing that developers outside of the US are actually kind of leading the way in diversifying the way to pay.

